Subject: package: export styles/foundation

What: package.json exports ./styles/foundation as src/styles/foundation.css.
Why: the app's signed-out sign-in document imports only the kit's foundation (layer order, tokens, base, utilities, animations) with no component sheet, through claxedo-app's src/ui/foundation.css.

diff --git a/package.json b/package.json
index 61ec7b6fcf..bffec06237 100644
--- a/package.json
+++ b/package.json
@@ -40,6 +40,7 @@
     "./context/*": "./src/context/*.tsx",
     "./styles": "./src/styles/index.css",
     "./styles/tailwind": "./src/styles/tailwind/index.css",
+    "./styles/foundation": "./src/styles/foundation.css",
     "./theme": "./src/theme/index.ts",
     "./theme/*": "./src/theme/*.ts",
     "./theme/context": "./src/theme/context.tsx",
